            <div xml:id="d135">

                <pb facs="0268" n="102" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg102"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/2697</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-29T15:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 29, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My August 22, 7 p.m. Acting President Feng is now favoring early election
                    compatible with [to?] Parliament as means of conciliating South.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
